{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51419","headline":"游九疑黄庭观（《全唐诗》七八作骆宾王《游灵公观》，诗中字句多有异同） · 李合","name":"游九疑黄庭观（《全唐诗》七八作骆宾王《游灵公观》，诗中字句多有异同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵峯标舜境，神府枕疑川。\n玉殿斜临汉，金堂逈架烟。\n断风疎晚竹，流水切寒弦。\n别有月帔上，寄怀骑鹤仙。\n（《文苑英华》卷二二六、江标影宋本《骆宾王集》卷中、《唐人三家集》本《骆宾王文集》〖据影宋蜀刻本翻雕〗卷四均收此诗爲骆作，作李诗恐非是。\n）（以上《古今图书集成·山川典》一七○《九疑山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}